---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
	title="FileMaker Development - ZeroBlue"
	description="Custom FileMaker development solutions tailored to your business needs"
	heroTitle="Custom FileMaker Development"
	heroSubtitle="Your business is unique. The software that runs your operations should be, too."
>
			<!-- Agile Development Section -->
			<section class="py-16">
				<div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5">
					<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-6 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 tracking-tight">Agile Development</h2>
					<p class="text-lg text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
						Your business is unique. The software that runs your operations should be, too, in order to best answer your needs.
						There are a lot of platforms to build databases on. We like FileMaker because it's agile. By using Custom FileMaker
						Development we can get you up and running in weeks instead of months. And we can always add more modules as your
						business expands or changes.
					</p>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Services Grid -->
			<section class="py-16">
				<h2 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-12 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200 tracking-tight text-center">Our Services</h2>
				<div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
					<!-- Data Conversion -->
					<div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Data Conversion</h3>
						<ul class="space-y-2 text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400">
							<li>• Word documents converted into forms and merge letters</li>
							<li>• Excel spreadsheets combined into one interconnected dataset</li>
							<li>• Great looking reports and charts</li>
							<li>• PDFs and other documents stored in the database</li>
						</ul>
					</div>

					<!-- Calendar & Contact Syncing -->
					<div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Calendar and Contact Syncing</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							Add scheduling or a calendar to your solution with SeedCode or SoSimple Calendar.
							Integrate iCal with your FileMaker events using Zulu, so you can see your schedule on your iPhone, iPad, or Android device.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Mobile Data Access -->
					<div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Mobile Data Access</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							Access your data on-the-go with FileMaker Go. We can develop a database with FileMaker Go in mind
							or add layouts to an existing solution. We can also create mobile websites that connect to your FileMaker Solution.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Document Management -->
					<div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Document Management</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							Manage paper files by adding scanning, barcode scanning and/or SuperContainer or DocuBin to your solution
							to manage your files in FileMaker.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Starter Solutions -->
					<div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Starter Solutions</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							We use starter solutions based on the FOCUS framework to cut down on development time so you can start using
							your solution as soon as possible. We don't like to reinvent the wheel; we'd rather concentrate on your business practice.
						</p>
					</div>

					<!-- Integration -->
					<div class="group p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white dark:bg-zinc-900 border border-zinc-200 dark:border-zinc-700 shadow-lg shadow-zinc-600/5 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/10 hover:border-sky-500/50">
						<h3 class="text-xl font-semibold mb-4 text-zinc-800 dark:text-zinc-200">Integration</h3>
						<p class="text-zinc-600 dark:text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
							We can integrate your solution with the web through ESS, with SQL, mySQL and Oracle. Or simply with WordPress.
						</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- CTA Section -->
			<section class="bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-400 via-blue-400 to-sky-400 dark:from-sky-500 dark:via-blue-500 dark:to-sky-500 rounded-lg shadow-xl p-12 text-center text-white">
				<h2 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4">Have a project in mind?</h2>
				<p class="text-xl mb-8">Let's discuss how we can help your business grow with custom FileMaker solutions.</p>
				<a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-zinc-50 text-primary px-8 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-zinc-100 transition-colors">
					Contact Us
				</a>
			</section>
</PageLayout>

